{
 "part": "script/script_0025",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0E7E",
   "src": "add3311b972b",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Let us in the Sperobo<NL>Gang, ya hear!<WAIT>We like that universe<NL>conquest bit, got it!<WAIT><FACE:4C>Sign us up, c'mon!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0EC6",
   "src": "58649c1fecd5",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Aaah?!<NL>Quit spacing out!<WAIT>Are we in or not?<NL>Spit it out, ya hear!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0EF5",
   "src": "dd341de991db",
   "t": "<FACE:4C>You got a problem<NL>with us, c'mon!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F0A",
   "src": "805093f6ca0e",
   "t": "<FACE:4E>Say something already!<NL>Huh?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F1D",
   "src": "4b739317445f",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>These guys are bad<NL>news-robo…<WAIT>Just ignore them-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F3E",
   "src": "12b6de1e872f",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>What'd you say, punk!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F49",
   "src": "07cc0cb069e2",
   "t": "<FACE:81>B-but as our flunkies<NL>we get to slack-robo<WAIT><FACE:7D>Why's that-robo?<NL><WAIT>They look strong-robo.<NL>Work 'em, take credit<WAIT><FACE:7F>I see-robo<NL><WAIT>We can dump the boss's<NL>yelling on them-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0FBF",
   "src": "024b0d5c965e",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Quit your mumbling<NL>already!<WAIT>Are we in or not?!<NL><WAIT>Which is it, punk!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0FF1",
   "src": "d389fbce13b1",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>F-fine-robo…<NL><WAIT>I-if you insist that<NL>much, you're in-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1015",
   "src": "f4898bb54c8f",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>For real, ya hear?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1020",
   "src": "67ada10b5963",
   "t": "<FACE:4C>We did it, c'mon!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:102B",
   "src": "2367551adc96",
   "t": "<FACE:4E>We're the Sperobo<NL>Gang now, huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:103F",
   "src": "34d6df0af71e",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>B-but you're only<NL>rookies-robo…<WAIT>Y-you do everything<NL>we tell you-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1072",
   "src": "82ea4923bf97",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Fine by us, ya hear!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1080",
   "src": "79ecb3acc2ce",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>…This feels kinda<NL>weird-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1094",
   "src": "edca2b26310d",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Whoa!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:109A",
   "src": "f39e4cac4103",
   "t": "<FACE:08>What is this place…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10A5",
   "src": "aa91f666bbdf",
   "t": "<FACE:08>Is this some kind of<NL>coliseum or what?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10BB",
   "src": "5f81749ba77c",
   "t": "<FACE:04>I've got a bad<NL>feeling…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10CD",
   "src": "a372783be69a",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Ladies and gentlemen!<NL><WAIT>The «Sperobo Cup»<NL>starts now-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10F5",
   "src": "e68cab3e8c96",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Ah, and click-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1102",
   "src": "f34f6593a4e0",
   "t": "<FACE:03>What the heck is this?<WAIT><FACE:7F>Round 1: the Rookies<NL>vs Challengers-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1134",
   "src": "816299152673",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Hey, did they just<NL>name our team for us?<WAIT><FACE:0B>That's messed up!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1161",
   "src": "de70bd5d8ce0",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Whatever<NL><WAIT>No matter who it is,<NL>we'll smash 'em!<WAIT><FACE:19>I'll help out too,<NL>if you'll have me!<WAIT><FACE:14>Me too!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11A5",
   "src": "55a65a65c68c",
   "t": "<FACE:00>By the way, what's<NL>the «Rookie» part?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11B6",
   "src": "385f5d8849bd",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>We're the Rookie<NL>Sperobos, ya hear!<WAIT><FACE:4C>Come and get us,<NL>c'mon!<WAIT><FACE:4E>What, you scared?<NL>Huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11EA",
   "src": "d87f7c1bdc1e",
   "t": "<FACE:08>What? Those are my<NL>classmates!<WAIT>What are you doing in<NL>a place like this?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1216",
   "src": "9df76e0c5cb0",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Pipe down, ya hear!<WAIT><FACE:4C>We're the Sperobo<NL>Gang, c'mon!<WAIT><FACE:4E>Rookies, huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1244",
   "src": "e0d40e4906b4",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Are these guys dumb<NL>or something?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1254",
   "src": "8aed1519ad0b",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Come at us, ya hear!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1263",
   "src": "19cce5025e79",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Robattle, fight-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1274",
   "src": "8770b7afe1b1",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>What'd you say, punk!<WAIT><FACE:4C>We lost, c'mon!<WAIT><FACE:4E>Not bad, <PLAYER>,<NL>huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:129B",
   "src": "ac35dc0631fb",
   "t": "<FACE:02>…Was that praise…?<WAIT><FACE:06>Quit being so casual!<NL>Shape up, class rep!<WAIT><FACE:00>You're right<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:12DD",
   "src": "2a03c036623a",
   "t": "<FACE:00>You guys, in a place<NL>like this…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:12EF",
   "src": "715c62892427",
   "t": "<FACE:80>Round 1 goes to the<NL>Challengers-roboo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:130D",
   "src": "e68cab3e8c96",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Ah, and click-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:131A",
   "src": "9698a7882903",
   "t": "<FACE:06>This one's obnoxious<NL>too"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:132A",
   "src": "36ef8fcc93f6",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Now, Round 2-robo!<NL><WAIT>Round 2: the Sperobos<NL>vs Challengers-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1358",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Click, there-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1364",
   "src": "fb321e66df76",
   "t": "<FACE:00>These look like the<NL>real ones this time"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1376",
   "src": "b91d84c87eb3",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Doesn't matter<WAIT><FACE:7F>Now then, Robattle<NL>fight-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1394",
   "src": "076ce53f0bc2",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Huh? What's up-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13A3",
   "src": "bdbd026f778d",
   "t": "<FACE:81>N-no way-robo!<NL><WAIT>Guys that tough lost.<NL>We can't win-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13DA",
   "src": "31cf70845421",
   "t": "<FACE:81>Y-yeah-robo!<NL><WAIT><FACE:80>Goodbyyye-robo!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13F3",
   "src": "07b5ef44d9a6",
   "t": "<FACE:81>Uhhhhh…<NL><WAIT>Trouble-robo…<NL><WAIT>R-Round 2: a forfeit,<NL>Challengers win-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:142D",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Click, there-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1439",
   "src": "e6c3ab214167",
   "t": "<FACE:08>Yes, yes. Now get<NL>on with the next one"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1451",
   "src": "7802ce560b8d",
