  {
   "key": "script:0025:14E1",
   "src": "4c5becaaad46",
   "t": "<FACE:81>U-uhhh-robo…<NL><WAIT>By forfeit, the<NL>Challengers win… robo<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:150B",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Click, there-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1517",
   "src": "89fb9fac3e45",
   "t": "<FACE:06>Ugh, enough already!<NL><WAIT>Just get on with the<NL>final already!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1539",
   "src": "a095932f9684",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>T-the final is<NL>against our Boss-robo<WAIT>We've prepared a<NL>special stage-robo<WAIT><FACE:04>A special stage?!"
