  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1663",
   "src": "5c7b158faf67",
   "t": "<FACE:73>You… who are you…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1674",
   "src": "91843de56e09",
   "t": "<FACE:03>W-w-w-who are you<NL>yourself!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:168A",
   "src": "4cb28a6b2738",
   "t": "<FACE:73>I'm… Kirika…<NL><WAIT>Today's fortune said…<NL>«a fated encounter»…<WAIT>Which means… you are…<NL>…my fated one…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:16DC",
   "src": "bd6c069d11db",
   "t": "<FACE:04>(Scary… she's kind of<NL>scary…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:16F2",
   "src": "30c3d9546fba",
   "t": "<FACE:73>My fated one…<NL>I won't let you go…<WAIT><FACE:03>Uh-wuh-wuh…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1710",
   "src": "9f84f83bb796",
   "t": "<FACE:03>The fog cleared up?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:171B",
   "src": "95119785ccd6",
   "t": "<FACE:05><PLAYER>!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1720",
   "src": "9e302420f0b0",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Oh, so that's where<NL>you guys were<WAIT><FACE:19>Honestly! Too old to<NL>be getting lost!<WAIT><FACE:14>That's what you get<NL>for not cooperating…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1773",
   "src": "99a3a5017c28",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Who…?<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:177C",
   "src": "5cab479269e4",
   "t": "<FACE:73>I'm… Sperobo officer<NL>Streetcorner Kirika…<WAIT>All of you…<NL>…my fated ones…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17B7",
   "src": "d1b0dbc3a837",
   "t": "<FACE:05>What are you saying?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17C5",
   "src": "06a31bae8525",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>The final at last-robo<NL><WAIT>Challengers versus<NL>our Boss Kirika-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17F6",
   "src": "82f5fcaf4f25",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>So if we beat these<NL>guys, we clear this?<WAIT><FACE:14>Easy as pie!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1820",
   "src": "da624e4794e2",
   "t": "<FACE:73>So fighting is fate…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1833",
   "src": "350fd6fec111",
   "t": "<FACE:80>Now then, Robattle<NL>fight-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1846",
   "src": "164100d1032f",
   "t": "<FACE:81>K-Kirika lost-robo!<NL>We're out of moves!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1873",
   "src": "e35918dc866a",
   "t": "<FACE:0D>Now, let us through"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1882",
   "src": "e552d387a240",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Mutter… mutter…<NL><WAIT>…So you beat me…<NL><WAIT>…I won't forget… ever…<NL><WAIT>…I won't… forget…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:18C9",
   "src": "7ebe9fd95030",
   "t": "<FACE:05>By the way, what were<NL>you doing here?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:18DE",
   "src": "e27e779ba3d2",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>We're joining the<NL>Sperobo Gang, got it!<WAIT><FACE:4E>You got a complaint,<NL>huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1907",
   "src": "bf8886d21b05",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>So you joined those<NL>weaklings? What for?<WAIT><FACE:4D>We're climbing to the<NL>top, ya hear"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:193B",
   "src": "e3df43cb99bc",
   "t": "<FACE:06>(Sure are worked up…)<NL><WAIT><FACE:05>With all that energy<NL>to spare, help us?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1970",
   "src": "b783c892758a",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>And why's that, punk!<WAIT><FACE:4E>Don't order us around,<NL>huh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:198F",
   "src": "d3be46ccdb2e",
   "t": "<FACE:07>Even though you lost<NL>to us?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19A0",
   "src": "d373d0c191f3",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Guh…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19A7",
   "src": "91e227f9a756",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Kanbatsu joined the<NL>team!<NL><WAIT><FACE:4C>Arashi joined the<NL>team!<NL><WAIT><FACE:4E>Kyoufuu joined the<NL>team!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19DF",
   "src": "9a4bc2b2c3a5",
   "t": "<FACE:08>Eeek!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19E7",
   "src": "3eb8bc6a3f91",
   "t": "<FACE:09>What a creepy girl…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19FA",
   "src": "d46193c85e24",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>It got all gloomy"
  }
 ]
